"_apple-screen-item_1uoaw_13"><div class="_apple-screen-video-wrapper_1uoaw_28" style="background-image:url()"><video class="_video_ttprb_1 _apple-screen-video_1uoaw_28" crossorigin="anonymous" src="https://static-cdn.deepway.com/portal/video/video-mpeg4/%E5%B9%B2%E7%BA%BF.mp4" poster="" muted="" preload="auto" playsinline="" disablepictureinpicture="" x5-video-player-type="h5" x5-video-player-fullscreen="true" x5-video-player-orientation="landscape" x5-video-player-mode="fullscreen"></video></div><div class="_mask_1uoaw_41"></div><div class="_footer-wrapper_1uoaw_50"><div class="_title_1uoaw_57">干线物流</div><div class="_desc_1uoaw_64">在固定线路上，大电量可加持更长续航里程。</div></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide _slide_1uoaw_6"><div class="_apple-screen-item_1uoaw_13"><div class="_apple-screen-video-wrapper_1uoaw_28" style="background-image:url()"><video class="_video_ttprb_1 _apple-screen-video_1uoaw_28" crossorigin="anonymous" src="https://static-cdn.deepway.com/portal/video/port.mp4" poster="" muted="" preload="auto" playsinline="" disablepictureinpicture="" x5-video-player-type="h5" x5-video-player-fullscreen="true" x5-video-player-orientation="landscape" x5-video-player-mode="fullscreen"></video></div><div class="_mask_1uoaw_41"></div><div class="_footer-wrapper_1uoaw_50"><div class="_title_1uoaw_57">港口环境</div><div class="_desc_1uoaw_64">小电量、低电耗，轻松实现短途运营的快速回报。</div></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide _slide_1uoaw_6"><div class="_apple-screen-item_1uoaw_13"><div class="_apple-screen-img-wrapper_1uoaw_23"><img src="" loading="eager" class="_apple-screen-img_1uoaw_18"/></div><div class="_mask_1uoaw_41"></div><div class="_footer-wrapper_1uoaw_50"><div class="_title_1uoaw_57">西部山区</div><div class="_desc_1uoaw_64">上坡电机功率更优，减少发热导致的限速问题；下坡搭配能量回收功能时，可进一步节省功耗。</div></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide _slide_1uoaw_6"><div class="_apple-screen-item_1uoaw_13"><div class="_apple-screen-video-wrapper_1uoaw_28" style="background-image:url()"><video class="_video_ttprb_1 _apple-screen-video_1uoaw_28" crossorigin="anonymous" src="https://static-cdn.deepway.com/portal/video/video-mpeg4/%E4%B8%A5%E5%AF%92.mp4" poster="" muted="" preload="auto" playsinline="" disablepictureinpicture="" x5-video-player-type="h5" x5-video-player-fullscreen="true" x5-video-player-orientation="landscape" x5-video-player-mode="fullscreen"></video></div><div class="_mask_1uoaw_41"></div><div class="_footer-wrapper_1uoaw_50"><div class="_title_1uoaw_57">严寒天气</div><div class="_desc_1uoaw_64">低温性能好，重点优化了车辆在低温环境下的充电、启动及电耗问题。</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="_apple-screen-indicator_1uoaw_70"><div class="_dots_1uoaw_77 "><div class="_dot-wrapper_1uoaw_90"><div class="_dot_1uoaw_77 _active_1uoaw_112"></div></div><div class="_dot-wrapper_1uoaw_90"><div class="_dot_1uoaw_77 "></div></div><div class="_dot-wrapper_1uoaw_90"><div class="_dot_1uoaw_77 "></div></div><div class="_dot-wrapper_1uoaw_90"><div class="_dot_1uoaw_77 "></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="_cockpit-wrapper_crx58_1" id="cockpit"><div class="_animate-title-wrapper_oxogc_1 _white_oxogc_1  _medium_oxogc_24"><div class="_title_oxogc_1" id="animate-title-bvcgd">智享座舱 轻松驾驭</div><div class="_subtitle_oxogc_4" id="animate-subtitle-bvcgd">开阔、现代且舒适的环抱式乘坐氛围，深向助您驰骋远方。</div></div><div class="_view_crx58_5" id="cockpit-view-wrapper"><div style="height:100%;width:100%"><canvas style="width:100%;height:100%"></canvas></div></div><div class="_cockpit-content_crx58_22"><div class="_pic-screen-wrapper_1hr9t_1"><div class="_header-wrapper_1hr9t_70"><div class="_left-wrapper_1hr9t_76"><div class="_title_1hr9t_57">全车智能方案</div><div class="_desc_1hr9t_64"><span>智能座舱集成270°全景影像，消除视觉盲区，配合天玑驾驶辅助系统，大幅降低长途奔波的疲劳感和事故风险。从高速跟车到车队调度，从能耗优化到远程诊断。一切智能，只为让你的每一趟运输，<span style="color:#3fd2ff">更安全、更高效、更省心。</span></span></div></div><div class="_right-wrapper_1hr9t_93"><div class="_controls-wrapper_1hr9t_96"><div class="_controls_1ccbq_1"><div class="_arrow-left_1ccbq_8 _white_1ccbq_23 _disabled_1ccbq_26"></div><div class="_arrow-right_1ccbq_30 _white_1ccbq_23 "></div></div></div></div></div><div class="swiper" ease="linear" lazy="[object Object]"><div class="swiper-wrapper"><div class="swiper-slide _slide_1hr9t_5"><div class="_pic-screen-item_1hr9t_22"><div class="_img-wrapper_1hr9t_29"><img src="/assets/pic-1-D7q5ZCy1.png" alt="驾驶守护，安全在途"/></div><div class="_mask_1hr9t_41"></div><div class="_footer-wrapper_1hr9t_50"><div class="_title_1hr9t_57">驾驶守护，安全在途</div><div class="_desc_1hr9t_64">辅助驾驶减少驾驶员操作负担，让长途运输更轻松、更安全；DMS实时监测驾驶员状态，及时发出声光提醒，避免危险驾驶。</div></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide _slide_1hr9t_5"><div class="_pic-screen-item_1hr9t_22"><div class="_img-wrapper_1hr9t_29"><img src="/assets/pic-2-SmX0lbgm.jpg" alt="车队管理，高效人车协同"/></div><div class="_mask_1hr9t_41"></div><div class="_footer-wrapper_1hr9t_50"><div class="_title_1hr9t_57">车队管理，高效人车协同</div><div class="_desc_1hr9t_64">基于AI算法打造的车队管理平台，将您的车队从“线下散兵”升级为“线上精兵”，实现全域车辆的数字化、可视化与智能化管理。</div></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide _slide_1hr9t_5"><div class="_pic-screen-item_1hr9t_22"><div class="_img-wrapper_1hr9t_29"><img src="/assets/pic-3-CwJJ0H_j.jpg" alt="AI 车队长"/></div><div class="_mask_1hr9t_41"></div><div class="_footer-wrapper_1hr9t_50"><div class="_title_1hr9t_57">AI 车队长</div><div class="_desc_1hr9t_64">智能问答助手通过自然语言交互简化复杂操作，将运营工作从“低效整合报表”升级为“一问即答”，显著提升效率。</div></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide _slide_1hr9t_5"><div class="_pic-screen-item_1hr9t_22"><div class="_img-wrapper_1hr9t_29"><img src="/assets/pic-4-9RuGHVdc.jpg" alt="极简操作，驾乘皆宜"/></div><div class="_mask_1hr9t_41"></div><div class="_footer-wrapper_1hr9t_50"><div class="_title_1hr9t_57">极简操作，驾乘皆宜</div><div class="_desc_1hr9t_64">直观的智能大屏交互，以及贴心的​​单踏板模式​​，大幅简化驾驶操作。​​平地板设计​​、​​气囊减震座椅​​，乘坐体验堪比乘用车。</div></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide _slide_1hr9t_5"><div class="_pic-screen-item_1hr9t_22"><div class="_img-wrapper_1hr9t_29"><img src="/assets/pic-5-TvSgnixQ.jpg" alt="流线型低风阻车身"/></div><div class="_mask_1hr9t_41"></div><div class="_footer-wrapper_1hr9t_50"><div class="_title_1hr9t_57">流线型低风阻车身</div><div class="_desc_1hr9t_64">行业首家流线型低风阻车身结合高度轻量化底盘设计，使风阻系数降低 40%-50%，成为全球已批量交付卡车中最低的风阻系数之一。</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="_customer-wrapper_kpxfx_1" id="customer-wrapper"><div class="_animate-title-wrapper_oxogc_1 _black_oxogc_7  _medium_oxogc_24"><div class="_title_oxogc_1" id="animate-title-zntxj">真正帮助客户</div><div class="_subtitle_oxogc_4" id="animate-subtitle-zntxj">从一线车队需求出发，提供可量化的长期价值。</div></div><div class="_customer-content-wrapper_kpxfx_5"><div class="_customer-content_kpxfx_5"><div class="_section2_kpxfx_25"><div class="_section2-child-1_kpxfx_33"><div class="_left_kpxfx_46"><div class="_title_kpxfx_46">降低事故率*</div><div class="_value_kpxfx_57"><div class="_val_kpxfx_57"><div class="counter-container"><div class="counter-counter" style="font-size:64px;gap:0"><div class="counter-digit" style="height:64px"><span class="counter-number" style="transform:translateY(320px)">0</span><span class="counter-number" style="transform:translateY(-256px)">1</span><span class="counter-number" style="transform:translateY(-192px)">2</span><span class="counter-number" style="transform:translateY(-128px)">3</span><span class="counter-number" style="transform:translateY(-64px)">4</span><span class="counter-number" style="transform:none">5</span><span class="counter-number" style="transform:translateY(64px)">6</span><span class="counter-number" style="transform:translateY(128px)">7</span><span class="counter-number" style="transform:translateY(192px)">8</span><span class="counter-number" style="transform:translateY(256px)">9</span></div><div class="counter-digit" style="height:64px"><span class="counter-number" style="transform:none">0</span><span class="counter-number" style="transform:translateY(64px)">1</span><span class="counter-number" style="transform:translateY(128px)">2</span><span class="counter-number" style="transform:translateY(192px)">3</span><span class="counter-number" styl